## Layer distinction (preserve)

```
canonical function          → 6 KEEP components
conditional concept binding → scoped overlay (compartment / feature / drive path)
manufacturer implementation → oemTermAliases, Jazz/Samsung/LG vocabulary
platform implementation     → inverter PBA, relay drive, linear compressor, F-DEF/R-DEF, sealed_system
model-specific behavior     → defer — not manufacturer vocabulary
```

